    4. Place 2-6 red passthrough rectangles scattered around the grid. Some should lie in ray paths (overlapping source row/col bands) so they get painted yellow. Ensure no object overlaps.
    5. Verify no two objects overlap (gap >= 1) and yellow (4) is absent.
